<Layout title="Privacy and contact information" description="Learn how this Legacy Music Group website handles visits and the local email-draft helper, and where booking and payment details are entered."><div class="shell"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Legacy Music Group</p><h1>Your information.<br /><em>A clear boundary.</em></h1></header><article class="reading"><h2>This website</h2><p>This site serves studio information. It does not use analytics or advertising scripts, set marketing cookies, or collect payment details. The hosting provider processes standard request information to deliver and protect the site.</p><h2>The contact brief</h2><p>The optional brief prepares an email in your browser. This website does not transmit the form fields, store the draft in browser storage, or send the message. You decide whether to open your email app or copy the draft, and whether to send it.</p><h2>Booking and external services</h2><p>Booking links lead to legacymusicgroup.com. That website handles its own forms, account information, checkout and privacy practices. Map links open Google Maps. Review the destination service’s information before providing personal details.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about a recording session or your information, contact info@legacymusicgroup.com. This notice describes this Netlify-hosted website, not every service operated by Legacy.</p></article></div></Layout>
